  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to strengthen regulatory frameworks in the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This grant would involve building up on the initiated collaboration with the EU MS regulatory authorities and the EMA (European Medicines Agency) toward strengthening the institutional frameworks for national and regional regulatory systems to enhance the role of medical product regulators through clear and comprehensive legal bases for minimum functions related to registration and marketing authorisation, licensing, inspection and market surveillance and control.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
